School Bus Tracking and Notification System

📌 Project Overview

The School Bus Tracking and Notification System is a web-based application designed to help parents and school administrators monitor school bus activities and receive important notifications.

The system helps parents stay informed about their children’s transportation by providing bus tracking information and notifications regarding bus arrival and departure.

🎯 Objectives

* To provide an easy way to monitor school bus activities.
* To improve communication between parents and school administrators.
* To provide timely notifications about bus arrival and departure.
* To improve student transportation safety.
* To reduce the uncertainty and waiting time for parents.

✨ Features

* Bus Tracking: Monitor school bus location and movement.
* Notifications: Receive important bus-related updates.
* Student Management: Maintain student information.
* Bus Management: Manage bus details and information.
* Admin Management: Manage system activities and records.
* Parent Communication: Help parents stay updated about transportation.

