⚙️ Installation and Execution

1. Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/rihana15172004/SchoolBusTrackingSystem.git

2. Open the project folder:

cd SchoolBusTrackingSystem

3. Install Flask:

pip install flask

4. Run the application:

python app.py

5. Open your browser and visit:

http://127.0.0.1:5000/

🔄 Working Process

1. The administrator manages bus and student details.
2. Bus-related information is maintained in the database.
3. The system provides bus tracking information.
4. Parents receive relevant notifications.
5. The system helps parents stay informed about school transportation.

